  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>展示你的收藏&nbsp;</strong>将你最喜欢的书排列起来，封面朝外。&ldquo;我的丈夫Robert喜欢设计，所以我们打造了一个专属于他的图书馆。&rdquo;</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "用小摆设架混搭艺术品。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/7c/e6/7ce6a11e9f74a0119fdb8c22e6742026.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/7c/e6/7ce6a11e9f74a0119fdb8c22e6742026.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>混搭媒体设备&nbsp;</strong>要想打造不拘一格的展示效果，将珍藏的纪念品和图片放在一起。&ldquo;我喜欢复古设计的明亮色彩和圆润造型。&rdquo;</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "用衣架就可以随时更换图片。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/01/c0/01c060b76b4774e3b76faf8273c1a766.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/01/c0/01c060b76b4774e3b76faf8273c1a766.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>将图片挂起来&nbsp;</strong>将图片夹在衣架上挂起来，打造一面可随时更换的图片墙。&ldquo;如果你想让墙面焕然一新，换图片可比粉刷墙壁方便多了！&rdquo;</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "工作时获取灵感。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
